{"server":"tw","storyId":"act18d3_level_act18d3_03_beg","groupId":"act18d3","stageId":"act18d3_03","title":"外來者","storyCode":"SV-3","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18d3/level_act18d3_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"a8ba89a6bb286177760df6a1916002d7815232cbebec25c99cadd9ce7309d3ed","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"斯卡蒂去海邊尋找食物，卻發現這片海裡除了怪物什麼都沒有。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你，依然在彷徨，仿佛一隻迷途的海魚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看他一眼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你想知道我帶她去了哪裡。你非常在意。我們的集會，你沒有資格參與，可你的眼神告訴我，你想知道我們將對她做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你是找回你們之間的手足之愛了嗎？你的內心是否在因為你的故交的遭遇而經受撕扯？感到不公？從而憤怒？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在試圖找尋你看不見的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你當然可以這麼回答。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我想傷害她。你錯了，我是想幫她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"只有弄清楚她的——你們的痛苦根源來自哪裡，我才能更好地幫助你們切除癥結，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你。你主動加入我們，你想溶進真正的海洋。等你完成這個任務，你骯髒的本質將得到淨化。這是海對你的恩賜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"而同樣的恩賜，最後也會給予你的故交們，只要她們能和你一樣，放下過去為敵時的狹見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"使你們團聚，這是第一步。理解你們，這是第二步。而到最後，你們也會理解我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你能適當地減少一些廢話，我們共事起來還能更融洽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我也可以說一些會使你高興的。你的故交——清醒的那個，她已經到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斯卡蒂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"自然不在。沒有我的邀請，沒人能進入這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她進城了，你知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你表現出了意外，這很有趣。這座城市裡的聲音，我都聽見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"祂讚賞我做的一切，賜予了我力量，令我的生命進一步延展。我的感知，我的心靈，都不再受縛於你所見到的軀殼裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我在靠近完美。我將收下你的嫉恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"說回你的故交——她來得比預期的還快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"“深海獵人血脈相連”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"她並不知道什麼在等著她。只因為你帶走了另一個，她就追到了這裡，一刻都不曾休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"真是令人驚歎的情誼。她知道你如今的樣子嗎？面對叛徒，她會怎麼做？是還信任你們的血脈聯繫、同僚舊情，還是一劍刺入你的身體？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"我很期待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（轉身就走）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要急著去找她。你做得很好。你將這一個帶回到她該待的地方，又將另一個引入了城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"他會滿意的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"你不需要知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"現在我們只等待。等到那個時候到來，你自然可以找你的故交，去傳達我們的邀請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"歌蕾蒂婭","speakerId":"avg_474_gladiia_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她未必會來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":"avg_npc_184","isRemote":false,"text":"她會來的。她會自己來找我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownd"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"又回來啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我們住的地方是北邊最好的房子，你看，這扇門還能關上。一扇能關上的門，在下雨天能幫你不少。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"附近有人，兩個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"他們呀，他們平時就在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"一百三十、一百三十一、一百三十二......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，磚頭，今天過得好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"一，二，三......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"可憐的傢伙，他又得重新來。他總坐在這裡，數街上有幾塊磚。悄悄告訴你，每天數出來的結果都不大一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，那是石柱，他喜歡繞著街上的柱子散步。陰雨天就不出來啦，他年紀不小了，沾了水腿會疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用管他們，他們也不會管你，就像他們也不管我一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"進來吧，歌手。正式介紹一下，裡面就是我家了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，鐵皮。嗨，牆灰。你們醒啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摸箱子）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"痛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，木框。你又把這個外面的人帶到家裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是壞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"她是外面來的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"長凳都挺喜歡她的，對不對啊，小長凳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......嗷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別咬！歌手的裙子都要被咬壞啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......倒還不會壞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"沾滿了口水，就沒這麼漂亮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗷，嗷嗷......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這孩子真的很喜歡你，歌手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你們瞧，長凳也想讓她留下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你在盤算的事。別以為，我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"不會有，好結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有呀，我什麼打算都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼說，隨你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"規則，不許打破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是你，還是她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我會看著的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......總算走啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"歌手，你不用怕。鐵皮就是這樣的人。他看上去很凶，但也不會真的對我做什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我知道你不怕，你比他們厲害得多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是想說，真要動手的話，哼，我也不會怕他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在歎氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這個桶空啦。盤子也是空的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我想想......或許床底下還有一些吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡，床？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，看起來很奇怪嗎？你家裡的床不是鐵做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不大在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"有些房子裡也能找到木頭床。木頭可有用哩。木頭可以燒，讓屋子變得又亮又暖和。有的時候你要是生病了，這裡的冬天可不好過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"欸嘿——瞧瞧，這是我的寶貝盒子。早上起來的時候塞得深了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以幫我一把，把這些乾了的海草從我眼前拿開。不，別扔在地上，就算不能吃了，它們也還能墊床鋪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好多東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我把有用的都藏在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"看看這個，這是我正在縫的衣服。最近磨好的貝殼針，比過去幾年的都要好用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"布料不大夠用，還得去城南好好翻翻，或許還有些埋更深的沒被拿走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"馬上天就要變冷了，我得加快些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不行，長凳，你不能動這個衣服！這是要給佩特拉奶奶的，她咳嗽越來越厲害了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"這也不行！給我鬆手啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"木框。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"說了多少次，不是木框，是畫框啦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"還有，這個也不能吃，就算給你也沒用呀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"木框......畫框？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽到他們這麼叫我了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道你叫安妮塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"安妮塔是我自己起的......我從佩特拉奶奶的故事裡聽來的，那個女孩和你一樣，很會唱歌。是不是比木框好聽多了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"我們這裡的人，大多沒有名字。什麼順嘴喊什麼。磚頭總在數磚塊，鐵皮家外面圍著鐵皮柵欄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"他們叫我木框。因為佩特拉奶奶是從這塊畫框下面找到我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說過自己的母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"她沒把我交給其他人，她夠勇敢了。在我出生的時候，我們這裡沒有孩子，孩子活不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"那年頭沒人敢惹佩特拉奶奶......她把吃的分給我。你別看她現在身體不好，她是這城裡最厲害的人哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"就連鐵皮都怕她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"現在好多啦。那個教士教會了我們如何活下去。你看長凳，還有那邊幾個孩子。我想我們這裡也能漸漸變得熱鬧起來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊......啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"只要別亂拿我的東西，你就還是個好孩子，是不是啊，小長凳？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"別的被拿走了都沒關係。晚上睡覺的時候，我把這盒子藏好。他們不知道怎麼找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我們這裡不分什麼你的我的。我明白藏東西不好。歌手，你不會說出去的對不對？你對我的東西也不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"你是客人，佩特拉奶奶教過我，我們要好好招待客人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"有了，我就記得有。看吧，這裡還剩下一條鱗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這氣味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"是半個月前的，還算新鮮哩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"掰一下，這一半......給長凳。嘿，長凳，這裡還有吃的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幼年居民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊......啊啊......（吞咽）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，這一半給你，你吃完把骨頭剩下，我還能煮上一鍋湯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"食物，我去找就可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"可是還沒到日子呀！你現在出門，不可能找到食物的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總要試試。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安妮塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_180","isRemote":false,"text":"說著說著就沒影了，真是個怪人啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibtownd"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......還跟著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibcoastd"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"海邊。她到海邊去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"對，鐵皮，你想的真對。她要下海。她準備到海裡去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"時候，還不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"教士說過的。要潮汐漲落一百次，我們下海，才被允許。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮，我們不能來。海邊，不許來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......這沒有意義。我們，阻止她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"阻止她？難道我們打得過她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"教士說，我們要等一百次，才能去。現在，只有九十九次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"她什麼都得不到。今天的海邊，什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"那她在找什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮，這裡好冷，我好餓，我們不能來，你也不要問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"海裡有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"就算知道，又能怎樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不知道。鐵皮，你說的，我都不知道。我不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"過去，我們最遠走到過哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"最西邊的西邊。好久了。那時候，我們個子，只有這麼高。城裡，吃的還能撿到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"邊界線。這個詞，不常用。我們看到了，這座城市的，邊緣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你，鐵皮，不是我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我那時候，餓暈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，要再走一段路。你要，推推運氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......是碰碰運氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，你總是，話都說不明白。教士教了你那麼多年。你都學不會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，鐵皮，有你。你能明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"那時候，你也這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直信我。你讓我拿了你的那份罐頭。我又走了一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"然後你回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"回來以後，你好幾天沒吃東西。我以為，你想餓死自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我是想過。可餓死自己，又有什麼意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"反正過不了多久，大家都會死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你嚇到我了。你那時候就這麼說。我不知道你在說什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"後來......教士來了。他來了，我才感到了變化。我們都有了變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"教士，好的生活。他說我們能有。他說的是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"是真的。因為......這是真理。他給我們看見的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"因為教士，我活了下來。我們都活了下來。這樣，很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"那條線，沒有人能跨過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"這條，海水的線嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的線。就像木框做的陷阱。外面來的，都攔住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也不要出去。這就是最好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮......你的腳，快要沾到水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"水......是的。我不要過去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"就算跨過去了......跨過去了，那裡可能也什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......鐵皮，你總算停下了腳步。你剛剛嚇壞我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你別像那樣，問這麼多問題。你一直問，跟木框差不多。她從來都是怪人，教士也說她不對，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"提問......幫不了我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"只有答案才有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你好厲害，鐵皮。教士說的話，就你記得最牢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"看，她一直在海邊走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮，你要去哪裡？你也要跟著去？不，這不對，我們本來就，不能跟著她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我們打不過她，連我都知道，我們沒法趕走她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"她回不來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"那......那倒是很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要她那個大箱子，裡面肯定有很多吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"箱子不在。她帶走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"只有這個......這個，她放在了石頭上。我不知道這是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"她一直拿著，應該是好東西吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我能不能......能不能咬一口，鐵皮？我真的好餓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"（叮咚）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這是什麼？我從來沒聽過這種聲音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"（叮咚，叮咚）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"快停下來吧，鐵皮，這聲音讓我的胸口和牙齒抖個不停。你愛拿著它就拿著，我還是回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有意義。這個也沒有意義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"這種沒用的東西。就該扔在地上。爛掉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一路跟著的，我以為是別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你，你回來了！這怎麼可能？這個時候，到海邊的，沒有人能回來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你想去海裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只在這附近走走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"海裡有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"這不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"你也變得越來越古怪了，鐵皮。你還在問這些我不懂的問題，我們不是來阻止她的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"現在她往回走。我們可以回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你都看見了。你知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵皮，你在發抖。你是不是生病了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"過來又怎樣？像剛才一樣，你把我們都打趴下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"海裡有東西，對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要動。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"牆灰！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"這石頭......她的動作，真快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我的嘴發出來的聲音嗎？鐵皮，我叫出了聲。我的心臟怦怦跳。我是不是也生病了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我以為，你的腦袋會砰一下炸開。就跟被砸爛的貝殼一樣，露出裡面白花花的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民B","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣我會死嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"下回試試就知道了。現在爛掉的是別的東西。我沒見過這種。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"男性居民A","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"它怎麼......還會動？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃吧，回城去。動作要快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斯卡蒂","speakerId":"avg_1012_skadiSP_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——記得把我的琴留下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
